<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves rise to 67.46 bln ringgit.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves rise to 67.46 bln ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves rose to 67.46 billion ringgit as at August 30 against 67.37 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement on Friday.  </p>
<p>The central bank's net assets rose to 96.13 billion ringgit from 95.86 billion two weeks earlier.</p>
<p>(In bln ringgit)    Aug 30     Aug 15	Aug 30, 1995</p>
<p>Reserves		67.46	67.37	   65.60</p>
<p>Net assets	    96.13	95.86	   91.46</p>
<p>Currency		20.04	19.51	   17.81</p>
<p>Govt paper	     3.25	 3.51	    1.66</p>
</text>
